{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11208280","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11208280","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1120828001:0":{"text":"あれ、アザミですよね？近くに凶暴そうなバードマウントもいますよ！","source_cn":"那是不是就是乳蓟？旁边还有一只看起来很凶恶的陆行鸟！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90085414E6A77381","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1120828002:0":{"text":"あぁ……やっぱり……あの子は毒にやられて、解毒するためにアザミの実を食べにきたようですね。","source_cn":"啊……果然……那是被毒物咬伤过的动物，为了解毒来找乳蓟吃了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B68CFD8DB3FC808","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1120828003:0":{"text":"あっしの毒に関する知識の多くは、こういう野生動物からこっそり学んだものなんです。バード先生、今日のところはすみません！","source_cn":"我这些门道，不少是从这些野生动物身上偷学的。今天对不住...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F9CBF6BCA738CD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿德":{"text":"アド","source":"阿德","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}